{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In a post-apocalyptic world, you are the legendary hunter behind the wheel of a tank!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BROTANK</i> is a top-down action roguelike infused with retro RPG elements, offering an unprecedented wasteland adventure. Recruit unique companions, collect powerful gear, upgrade your tank, hunt down criminals, and uncover the secrets of a broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Diverse Companions &amp; Tanks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hunter is unique. Each tank comes with its own tactical possibilities and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6361\u5230\u5e9f\u5f03\u7684\u6218\u8f66.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u8425\u6551\u540c\u4f34.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Powerful Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your firepower and take on even stronger enemies with high-impact upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u88c5\u5907\u5408\u6210.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Deep Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different playstyles through varied tank loadouts and pilot combinations. Adapt to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6784\u7b5102.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6784\u7b51.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Intense Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study enemy weaknesses and strike with precision. Victory favors the prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u591a\u4e2a\u5173\u5361\u96be\u5ea6\u9009\u62e9.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6311\u6218\u5f3a\u5927\u7684boss.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and modify your tank to suit your combat needs \u2014 style meets function in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join <i>BROTANK</i> and carve your legend into the ashes of the old world!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae About This Dem<strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 full-difficulty stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 selectable pilots and 3 types of tanks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 types of weapons and components for combat and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic tank modification and enhancement systems</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>The full version will include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 maps in total, each with 3 difficulty levels (6 major stages in total)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 pilots, 8 tanks, and 44+ weapons and components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more complete upgrade system and final boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully fleshed-out backstory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425110?t=1749823264","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749823264","caps