_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u88c5\u5907\u5408\u6210.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Deep Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different playstyles through varied tank loadouts and pilot combinations. Adapt to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6784\u7b5102.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6784\u7b51.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Intense Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study enemy weaknesses and strike with precision. Victory favors the prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u591a\u4e2a\u5173\u5361\u96be\u5ea6\u9009\u62e9.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/extras/\u6311\u6218\u5f3a\u5927\u7684boss.gif?t=1749823264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and modify your tank to suit your combat needs \u2014 style meets function in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join <i>BROTANK</i> and carve your legend into the ashes of the old world!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae About This Dem<strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 full-difficulty stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 selectable pilots and 3 types of tanks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">24 types of weapons and components for combat and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic tank modification and enhancement systems</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>The full version will include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 maps in total, each with 3 difficulty levels (6 major stages in total)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 pilots, 8 tanks, and 44+ weapons and components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A more complete upgrade system and final boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully fleshed-out backstory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Dfirend Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3029570","name":"BROTANK"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425110/506ed00d72df08d3a769bde48c99207c57317e5f/header.jpg?t=1749823264","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2024 Dfirend Games. All rights reserved. This game is for personal use only and may not be used for commercial purposes. Unauthorized copying, modification, distribution, or use for other purposes is prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257084976,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084976/movie480.mp4?t=1749221690","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084976/movie_max.mp4?t=1749221690"},"name":"BROTANK DEMO","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257084976/0936fd4b8c9c853d7076c6e8cd14b24ec662fa6d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749221690","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084976/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749221690","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084976/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749221690"}}],"name":"BROTAN